#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(C) expedited benefits shall be provided to the family` `s 2031 by submission and approval of an application for participation in the Project` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(C) expedited benefits shall be provided to the family` `s 2031 by submission and approval of an application for participation in the Project` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(C) expedited benefits shall be provided to the family` `s 2031 by assigning a family determined eligible for or participating in the part A of title IV program or the supplemental nutrition assistance program` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the form: designated food assistance, or expedited benefits through the supplemental nutrition assistance program.
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(C) the expedited benefits take a form the text allows` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(C) the expedited benefits take a form the text allows` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(C) the expedited benefits take a form the text allows` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(C) the expedited benefits take a form the text allows` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- src:2877 | (D) each individual who contacts the State in person during office hours to make what may reasonably be interpreted as an oral or written request to receive financial assistance shall receive and shall be permitted to file an application form on the same day such contact is first made;
