-- a telephone or after-hours contact, or no request: not covered.
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(D) the individual received the form and was permitted to file on the same day` `s 2031 by submission and approval of an application for participation in the Project` FALSE TRUE TRUE 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2031(b)(6)(D) the individual received the form and was permitted to file on the same day` `s 2031 by submission and approval of an application for participation in the Project` TRUE FALSE TRUE 0 EQUALS NOTHING
